  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to transcribe ease. When you Cast the Spell, any time you @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.OizxuPb44g3eHPFh]{Borrow an Arcane Spell}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.ftG89SjTSa9DYDOD]{Create Forgery}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.d9gbpiQjChYDYA2L]{Decipher Writing}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Q5iIYCFdqJFM31GW]{Learn a Spell}, or @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge (Lore)} you gain a +1 status bonus to the skill or perception used for the roll. This bonus remains as long as you Sustain the Spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Scribe's Insight.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\">@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron-compendium.eberron-effects.Xfy79Xy5SZuIb311]{Spell Effect: Scribe's Insight}</p>"
    },
